BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Eskenazi School of Art, Architecture + Design
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261204
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261205
LOCATION:Fine Arts Building\, 1201 East 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
GEO:39.169084;-86.518997
SUMMARY:BFA Fall 2026 Thesis Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:These shows will feature work created by graduating Bachelor 
 of Fine Arts students in IU's Eskenazi School of Art\, Architecture + Des
 ign. The BFA Thesis Exhibitions represent the culmination of each student
 's undergraduate research in the arts. Students will work with the galler
 y to plan and install their thesis work. The exhibition will feature artw
 ork by students graduating with a concentration in a variety of studio ar
 eas: graphic design\, painting\, photography\, and sculpture.Closing rece
 ption: Friday\, December 11\, 6–8pmExhibition: Tuesday\, December 1–F
